<title>GERMANY: W.German prelim Dec CPI rises 0.3 pct from Nov.</title>
<headline>W.German prelim Dec CPI rises 0.3 pct from Nov.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PRELIM W.GERMAN INFLATION    Dec 96	   Nov 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)   +0.3	     -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)	   +1.4	     +1.4</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		  n/a	    114.3</p>
<p>Note - The Statistics Office also said that preliminary data show average CPI inflation of 1.4 percent for 1996 compared to the previous year.</p>
<p>The new data are provisional. The Statistics Office said it would publish final figures in mid-January.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
